327
00:16:37,480 --> 00:16:38,320
Why, you!

328
00:16:38,640 --> 00:16:39,520
My cards!

329
00:16:40,020 --> 00:16:44,120
Those were the Exodia cards that
my grandpa gave me! I'll get them!

330
00:16:44,480 --> 00:16:45,520
