ago, when we were kids.

362
00:18:29,200 --> 00:18:31,920
She lives far away, with my mother.

363
00:18:32,380 --> 00:18:35,321
My sisters had really bad
eyes since she was born.

364
00:18:36,400 --> 00:18:38,100
Eventually, she'll go blind.

365
00:18:38,460 --> 00:18:39,290
I'm

366
00:18:40,180 --> 00:18:41,010
sorry.

367
00:18:41,093 --> 00:18:41,923
Thanks, Yug.

368
00:18:42,006 --> 00:18:43,120
She sent me a message.

369
00:18:43,920 --> 00:18:46,840
I was hoping to see you one last time.

370
00:18:50,000 --> 00:18:52,517
The doctors told her
that the time has come.

371
00:18:52,600 --> 00:18:55,717
